{"title":"Thanks Giving Dance Party + 40 Crowd @ The Old Mill","startsAt":"2026-10-10T19:30:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-10T23:59:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Singles Dance Party + 40 Crowd\n\n**Saturday October 10th**\n7.30pm -12.30\n**The Old Mill**\n**21 Old Mill Rd.**\nJoin us for a fabulous a Saturday night of Dancing & Romancing . We have a great DJ playing all your favorite tunes from the 70’s to the present. It’s your opportunity to mix, mingle, enjoy a few dances and meet some new friends. You can dance the night away on their big dance floor. Please, no running shoes or jeans. The cover is only $20.00. 416- 236- 8222\nHope to see you then! Singles Dance Party + 40 Crowd","venue":{"name":"The Old Mill","address":"21 Old Mill rd, toronto","lat":43.651188,"lng":-79.493677,"city":"toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"SinglesParties.com","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/6/1/7/7/highres_536064951.jpeg"}